WEBVTT

00:00:00.587 --> 00:00:01.150
Hello!

00:00:01.180 --> 00:00:04.350
New customers usually look a salon up online before they visit.

00:00:04.616 --> 00:00:06.430
So how does your salon look to them?

00:00:06.779 --> 00:00:08.669
VaraaAi has a free check:

00:00:08.854 --> 00:00:12.431
it scores your salon's website, Google, Facebook and Instagram,

00:00:12.381 --> 00:00:15.790
and then shows you exactly what to do to win more customers.

00:00:15.974 --> 00:00:17.070
It only takes about a minute.

00:00:17.726 --> 00:00:23.466
Open varaaai.com, scroll to the bottom of the page, and tap Free salon check.

00:00:23.975 --> 00:00:28.266
In the Check your salon box, enter your Salon name and Salon address.

00:00:28.616 --> 00:00:34.746
Then the Salon type, for example nail salon, hair salon, spa or lash studio.

00:00:35.094 --> 00:00:36.666
If you have a website, add it.

00:00:36.775 --> 00:00:37.946
If you don't, that's fine.

00:00:38.588 --> 00:00:40.104
Next, one question:

00:00:40.468 --> 00:00:42.824
does your salon have a Google Business Profile?

00:00:43.093 --> 00:00:46.024
Choose Yes, Not sure, or No.

00:00:46.293 --> 00:00:48.024
Then tap Check for free now.

00:00:48.202 --> 00:00:50.184
No email, and no sign-up.

00:00:50.791 --> 00:00:53.321
A few seconds later, your report appears.

00:00:53.524 --> 00:00:56.761
At the top is your Online presence score, out of a hundred.

00:00:57.109 --> 00:00:59.161
Below are the scores for each channel:

00:00:59.265 --> 00:01:02.841
Website, Google profile, Facebook and Instagram.

00:01:03.190 --> 00:01:06.281
Each one gets a rating, such as Strong, or Weak.

00:01:06.630 --> 00:01:08.361
Tap View details to see why.

00:01:08.906 --> 00:01:11.644
The most important part is Your biggest opportunities.

00:01:12.129 --> 00:01:15.863
It lists the things that most affect whether a customer picks your salon,

00:01:15.813 --> 00:01:16.923
each with What to do.

00:01:17.305 --> 00:01:20.517
Here, for example, the salon doesn't have a website,

00:01:20.467 --> 00:01:24.044
so the advice is to create a free booking page on VaraaAi.

00:01:24.465 --> 00:01:27.004
The report also suggests Keywords to target.

00:01:27.617 --> 00:01:30.030
Tap Print or Save PDF to keep the report,

00:01:29.980 --> 00:01:33.659
and tap Check another salon if you have more than one location.

00:01:34.006 --> 00:01:38.139
Each time you finish a task, run the check again, and watch your score go up.

00:01:38.327 --> 00:01:40.459
Here's to your salon standing out online!

00:01:40.651 --> 00:01:41.899
Now take the quiz below.
